":2692511201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gfHXh","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-02T01:56:08Z","updated_at":"2025-03-02T01:56:08Z","body":"This requires some risky changes to core ConfigFile classes, so we are bumping this to 4.5. We need this for the new import material editor, so this is important. Maybe it can even be backported to 4.4.1 as a bugfix, but we can't fix this in time for 4.4","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692511201/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2958156044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99910#issuecomment-2958156044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99910","id":2958156044,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wUeEM","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T08:28:05Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T08:28:05Z","body":"Now that #106902 has been merged, it should address the most common cases of renaming.\n\nThere are still some issues that we need investigated.\n\n1. While it's good that we have uid references, moving files in editor should also update the filepaths in the .import file, so we are not as dependent on the uids.\n2.  If a dependency is deleted, it may be desirable to return \"null\" rather than returning a parse error.\n3. Finally, uids seem to be generally buggy, for example when a file is added to the project from outside the editor, the uid is sometimes not registered or cached in uid_cache.bin - if you hit this sort of bug and then rename a file, the uid reference may be lost and cause an error in the .import fil.\n\nI think the current state is good enough to unblock the other features (material editing workflow, script selection), but we need to keep our eye out for these issues and maybe come up with bugfixes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2958156044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confuse